WEBVTT

00:15.520 --> 00:16.810
<b>It's so him!</b>

00:16.860 --> 00:19.340
<b>Hey, you should wear that to school!</b>

00:19.600 --> 00:22.530
<b>What do you think, Shizuka?
It's a great look, right?</b>

00:22.710 --> 00:24.880
<b>Huh? Oh, yeah! It sure is!</b>

00:25.090 --> 00:28.140
<b>I thought your outfit looked great today!</b>

00:28.290 --> 00:30.090
<b>Especially the butterfly… tie…</b>

00:31.990 --> 00:33.510
<b>Uh, um…</b>

00:33.900 --> 00:36.110
<b>Sorry, what were you talking about?</b>

00:36.200 --> 00:37.500
<b>How funny Uryu loo…</b>

00:37.500 --> 00:38.630
<b>Wow, really?</b>

00:38.890 --> 00:40.670
<b>I love that tie, too!</b>

00:41.870 --> 00:44.030
<b>Well, can't blame you for worrying.</b>

00:44.220 --> 00:46.140
<b>Kanji's off in a fight, after all.</b>

00:47.400 --> 00:48.200
<b>But hey.</b>

00:49.010 --> 00:53.470
<b>He's not the type to go down easy. You know that.</b>

00:54.170 --> 00:55.020
<b>So.</b>

00:55.420 --> 00:57.070
<b>Don't look so down, okay?</b>

00:58.910 --> 01:01.380
<b>Okay. You're right.</b>

01:01.870 --> 01:04.010
<b>Sorry, I gotta use the bathroom!</b>

01:05.440 --> 01:08.340
<b>Now's our chance. Let's make
him look even funnier.</b>

01:08.470 --> 01:09.630
<b>That wasn't enough?</b>

01:10.200 --> 01:14.480
<b>And really, doesn't Kanji fight,
like, all day every day?</b>

01:14.820 --> 01:16.670
<b>Does she get like this every time?</b>

01:17.080 --> 01:18.090
<b>Who knows.</b>

01:18.540 --> 01:22.460
<b>Well, I guess everyone was acting
a bit odd before they left.</b>

01:23.020 --> 01:27.230
<b>Is it possible that this fight has
something to do with Shizuka?</b>

01:30.500 --> 01:35.960
<b>Even if it does, she's still a
good girl and a great singer.</b>

01:37.520 --> 01:38.300
<b>Besides…</b>

01:39.150 --> 01:41.340
<b>Every girl has a secret or two.</b>

01:42.330 --> 01:43.680
<b>That's just normal.</b>

01:44.360 --> 01:46.620
<b>Sure, sure. That Phantom of the Opera?</b>

01:46.680 --> 01:48.240
<b>It's a masquerade mask.</b>

01:48.720 --> 01:50.780
<b>That aside, Shizuka's taking a long…</b>

01:54.220 --> 01:55.050
<b>She wouldn't…</b>

03:31.660 --> 03:33.300
<b>Wow, this is intense.</b>

03:33.480 --> 03:34.990
<b>A real boss fight.</b>

03:35.400 --> 03:37.320
<b>We're using a lotta resources.</b>

03:38.970 --> 03:39.940
<b>But for all that…</b>

03:45.070 --> 03:47.310
<b>He's the only one acting weird.</b>

03:48.120 --> 03:49.420
<b>Well, either way.</b>

03:50.340 --> 03:52.510
<b>Everyone else is getting low on HP.</b>

03:55.990 --> 03:58.060
<b>You're getting weaker!</b>

03:58.330 --> 03:58.890
<b>Huh?!</b>

04:01.410 --> 04:02.640
<b>You're mine!</b>

04:05.790 --> 04:06.520
<b>Move!</b>

04:06.820 --> 04:07.570
<b>My bad!</b>

04:15.210 --> 04:15.930
<b>Back then…</b>

04:16.440 --> 04:20.220
<b>If we can do that, it doesn't
matter if we win or lose.</b>

04:20.730 --> 04:23.440
<b>I thought that was so cool,</b>

04:24.190 --> 04:27.420
<b>but I didn't think about what it meant!</b>

04:28.050 --> 04:31.080
<b>It's everyone getting taken
out right in front of me!</b>

04:31.840 --> 04:32.960
<b>And that…</b>

04:33.430 --> 04:34.680
<b>That's just…</b>

04:35.280 --> 04:36.250
<b>Sakura!</b>

04:41.760 --> 04:42.560
<b>Hey!</b>

04:43.160 --> 04:43.870
<b>What?!</b>

04:44.080 --> 04:44.800
<b>Kanji!</b>

04:48.140 --> 04:50.380
<b>Ahh, sorry, my bad.</b>

04:50.970 --> 04:53.400
<b>I almost walloped a friendly!</b>

04:54.350 --> 04:55.270
<b>You…</b>

04:56.300 --> 04:58.360
<b>Sakura, you still good to go?</b>

04:58.410 --> 05:00.450
<b>O-Of course I am! What are you…</b>

05:00.460 --> 05:01.190
<b>Alright!</b>

05:01.770 --> 05:04.510
<b>Then you two get back to the club.</b>

05:05.770 --> 05:06.350
<b>Wha…</b>

05:06.470 --> 05:09.790
<b>I promised Tsubaki I'd give you guys back.</b>

05:10.000 --> 05:11.040
<b>That's right.</b>

05:11.480 --> 05:15.480
<b>It's wrong to have our guests
fight for us, in the first place.</b>

05:16.790 --> 05:18.680
<b>Drop by my pub after.</b>

05:18.960 --> 05:20.750
<b>I'll give you all you can eat.</b>

05:21.310 --> 05:23.160
<b>I'll throw in a piano performance.</b>

05:24.190 --> 05:26.760
<b>- Screw that! I told you, this is my fight!</b>

05:26.760 --> 05:27.400
<b>- Sakura.
</b>

05:28.060 --> 05:29.980
<b>Sorry for putting so much on you.</b>

05:30.240 --> 05:31.650
<b>I'm really grateful.</b>

05:32.530 --> 05:36.010
<b>But if I can't at least keep
my promise to give you back,</b>

05:36.300 --> 05:37.930
<b>I'll never forgive myself.</b>

05:39.020 --> 05:41.000
<b>So I'll ask one more time.</b>

05:41.920 --> 05:45.070
<b>Could you let us play the cool guys here?</b>

05:46.540 --> 05:47.420
<b>Why?</b>

05:48.310 --> 05:49.770
<b>Why can't I say anything?</b>

05:51.110 --> 05:52.000
<b>Eyepatch.</b>

05:56.330 --> 05:57.870
<b>Sakura, let's head back.</b>

05:58.280 --> 06:00.410
<b>We'll move Shizuka somewhere safe.</b>

06:01.100 --> 06:02.320
<b>Yaaay.</b>

06:02.970 --> 06:04.790
<b>I finally found the main body.</b>

06:06.090 --> 06:07.920
<b>Victory is at hand!</b>

06:10.320 --> 06:11.000
<b>Go!</b>

06:12.700 --> 06:14.260
<b>H-Hey! Let go!</b>

06:14.260 --> 06:14.860
<b>Sakura.</b>

06:15.680 --> 06:18.400
<b>Let's make sure we protect Shizuka.</b>

06:21.790 --> 06:22.350
<b>Shit.</b>

06:23.560 --> 06:25.600
<b>Is this really our only option?</b>

06:26.700 --> 06:28.410
<b>If only I was stronger…</b>

06:28.910 --> 06:30.090
<b>Stop this!</b>

06:38.610 --> 06:41.080
<b>Stop this. Please.</b>

06:41.520 --> 06:42.890
<b>Shizuka…?</b>

06:43.980 --> 06:44.570
<b>Wh…</b>

06:44.840 --> 06:45.610
<b>Why?</b>

06:46.490 --> 06:47.400
<b>Hmm?</b>

06:48.540 --> 06:49.190
<b>Huh?</b>

06:50.190 --> 06:51.720
<b>Oh! It is her!</b>

06:52.400 --> 06:53.720
<b>Narita Shizuka!</b>

06:55.100 --> 06:56.700
<b>You came to us?</b>

06:57.230 --> 06:58.920
<b>Wait, does that mean…</b>

06:59.440 --> 07:00.910
<b>This is game clear?</b>

07:02.230 --> 07:04.310
<b>Why did you come here?! Go back!</b>

07:05.660 --> 07:06.480
<b>I…</b>

07:07.750 --> 07:09.630
<b>I'll go with you!</b>

07:10.190 --> 07:12.170
<b>You… What are you saying…?</b>

07:12.180 --> 07:13.010
<b>That way…</b>

07:14.280 --> 07:16.630
<b>this won't have to keep going, will it?</b>

07:23.260 --> 07:23.930
<b>Nire…</b>

07:24.280 --> 07:26.690
<b>Don't go with them.</b>

07:27.400 --> 07:30.170
<b>I know how frustrating it is to be powerless.</b>

07:30.900 --> 07:32.860
<b>I can't do anything, either.</b>

07:33.830 --> 07:35.200
<b>But that doesn't matter.</b>

07:35.580 --> 07:37.630
<b>Watching Kanji and the rest fight,</b>

07:38.110 --> 07:41.370
<b>it's painfully obvious how much
they want to protect you.</b>

07:42.110 --> 07:43.930
<b>If you turn yourself over now,</b>

07:44.430 --> 07:48.760
<b>then their feelings and pain
will all have been for nothing!</b>

07:49.430 --> 07:50.130
<b>And so…</b>

07:50.680 --> 07:51.980
<b>I can't let you go!</b>

07:55.500 --> 07:56.430
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:58.210 --> 07:58.960
<b>But, you see…</b>

07:59.940 --> 08:03.890
<b>I know they all want to keep me safe, but…</b>

08:05.060 --> 08:08.220
<b>My desire to repay them is just as big.</b>

08:09.320 --> 08:10.750
<b>When I first came here,</b>

08:11.500 --> 08:13.480
<b>I was at wit's end,</b>

08:14.250 --> 08:16.900
<b>but he accepted me without prying at all.</b>

08:18.940 --> 08:21.970
<b>So, is there anything you like to do?</b>

08:22.280 --> 08:25.880
<b>Huh? Uh… I like to sing.</b>

08:26.070 --> 08:28.720
<b>Wow. Sing a little for me!</b>

08:28.760 --> 08:31.230
<b>N-No, I'm not good enough to sing for anyone…</b>

08:31.370 --> 08:32.950
<b>It's fine, go ahead!</b>

08:33.720 --> 08:37.410
<b>With a nice flow, always aglow.</b>

08:37.660 --> 08:45.580
<b>Every day I dream with you fuels all of my moods.</b>

08:45.840 --> 08:48.590
<b>Singing for you.</b>

08:49.860 --> 08:52.410
<b>Dreams I pursue.</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:56.200
<b>True love.</b>

08:58.480 --> 09:00.240
<b>Sorry, I'm just an amateur…</b>

09:00.240 --> 09:03.010
<b>Incredible! You're downright amazing!</b>

09:03.310 --> 09:05.690
<b>Come sing on our stage, I beg you!</b>

09:05.850 --> 09:08.760
<b>I'll make sure the manager agrees to let you!</b>

09:09.890 --> 09:13.160
<b>My life here has been like a dream ever since.</b>

09:14.730 --> 09:17.220
<b>I've been surrounded by wonderful people,</b>

09:20.110 --> 09:21.430
<b>and above all else…</b>

09:22.840 --> 09:25.360
<b>I even found my first love.</b>

09:26.780 --> 09:31.500
<b>I've gotten to experience more joyous
times than I could possibly ask for.</b>

09:32.320 --> 09:35.950
<b>But I can't bear to see everyone
get hurt for my sake anymore.</b>

09:36.680 --> 09:38.170
<b>It's not necessary.</b>

09:39.680 --> 09:42.090
<b>So please, let me go.</b>

09:44.130 --> 09:45.330
<b>Shizuka…</b>

09:49.170 --> 09:51.200
<b>What's so funny?</b>

09:51.450 --> 09:54.280
<b>Oh, please. What isn't?</b>

09:54.700 --> 09:56.480
<b>Dreams? Love?</b>

09:57.030 --> 09:59.480
<b>You're too poor for those luxuries.</b>

10:00.610 --> 10:01.500
<b>You.</b>

10:01.790 --> 10:03.940
<b>You're from the same place as us, yeah?</b>

10:06.110 --> 10:08.080
<b>That means… Sunaba?</b>

10:08.770 --> 10:13.990
<b>You lived alone, with no relatives,
relying on low-paying cleaning jobs,</b>

10:14.700 --> 10:17.800
<b>but then a rich old bastard offered to buy you,</b>

10:18.030 --> 10:19.580
<b>and you went and ran?</b>

10:20.500 --> 10:24.480
<b>When people from our walk of life start
talking about love or dreams,</b>

10:24.650 --> 10:27.290
<b>it only brings misfortune to others.</b>

10:28.110 --> 10:29.030
<b>Look around you.</b>

10:29.580 --> 10:30.960
<b>This is reality.</b>

10:33.550 --> 10:35.370
<b>Of all the fool things…</b>

10:35.950 --> 10:37.150
<b>Screw you!</b>

10:37.520 --> 10:39.520
<b>Don't mind him, Shizuka! Go back!</b>

10:39.870 --> 10:41.590
<b>We don't need to beat him now,</b>

10:41.830 --> 10:42.870
<b>just hold him.</b>

10:44.470 --> 10:46.680
<b>Come on, Narita Shizuka!</b>

10:47.240 --> 10:50.380
<b>If you make it over here, this'll all stop!</b>

10:52.440 --> 10:53.170
<b>Shizuka!</b>

10:55.550 --> 10:56.750
<b>I'll grab her and run!</b>

10:56.830 --> 10:58.720
<b>Got it! Leave these guys to me!</b>

10:59.180 --> 11:02.100
<b>It's okay. I'm okay.</b>

11:03.470 --> 11:05.050
<b>I got to do what I love,</b>

11:05.610 --> 11:07.120
<b>be with people I love.</b>

11:09.010 --> 11:12.940
<b>I can keep living on just those memories alone.</b>

11:19.680 --> 11:22.080
<b>Sakura! Stop her!</b>

11:29.690 --> 11:30.510
<b>You guys…</b>

11:34.260 --> 11:35.470
<b>Oh, you.</b>

11:36.320 --> 11:39.470
<b>You vanished on us. That was a real scare!</b>

11:41.320 --> 11:44.380
<b>Stay back! I can't stay here!</b>

11:44.650 --> 11:46.750
<b>You can't? So what?</b>

11:47.400 --> 11:50.010
<b>If I… wasn't here…</b>

11:50.600 --> 11:52.510
<b>Nobody would have to get hurt!</b>

11:53.790 --> 11:54.330
<b>And?</b>

11:55.390 --> 11:57.030
<b>What do you want?</b>

12:03.480 --> 12:07.700
<b>I want… to stay with everyone.</b>

12:11.850 --> 12:12.860
<b>I want that, too.</b>

12:24.460 --> 12:26.390
<b>Now, you're gonna be okay.</b>

12:27.000 --> 12:29.370
<b>Stand back, will you?</b>

12:30.420 --> 12:33.450
<b>I'm sorry for getting you involved…</b>

12:33.890 --> 12:36.130
<b>Aw, don't be so distant.</b>

12:37.260 --> 12:39.420
<b>I'm doing this for my cute little sis.</b>

12:39.900 --> 12:40.990
<b>It's only natural!</b>

12:41.390 --> 12:42.600
<b>Uuugh.</b>

12:43.260 --> 12:48.250
<b>Seriously? I have no idea who you are,
but spawning outta nowhere is just cruel.</b>

12:49.040 --> 12:52.980
<b>And here I finally woke her up
from her love dream or whatever.</b>

12:53.600 --> 12:56.300
<b>You wanna live above your station that bad?</b>

12:57.170 --> 13:01.210
<b>Thanks to that, we're gonna have
to beat down everyone here.</b>

13:05.280 --> 13:06.370
<b>What's so funny?</b>

13:07.120 --> 13:08.600
<b>That "your station" bit.</b>

13:09.310 --> 13:12.350
<b>You're jealous of Shizuka, aren't you?</b>

13:13.310 --> 13:13.910
<b>Huh?</b>

13:14.280 --> 13:20.090
<b>People who make fun of what others love
tend to be dissatisfied, themselves.</b>

13:20.510 --> 13:21.930
<b>I don't get it.</b>

13:22.370 --> 13:24.960
<b>And it pisses me off so much I'm getting dizzy.</b>

13:25.370 --> 13:27.700
<b>I'm over it. Let's end this.</b>

13:28.380 --> 13:30.580
<b>Guys, the reward is ours for the taking.</b>

13:31.360 --> 13:33.630
<b>Go all-out and crush them.</b>

13:39.190 --> 13:39.850
<b>Shit!</b>

13:40.060 --> 13:41.530
<b>Sakura! Suo!</b>

13:41.640 --> 13:42.470
<b>What?!</b>

13:42.910 --> 13:43.800
<b>You, too, Nirei.</b>

13:44.450 --> 13:45.180
<b>Yes?</b>

13:46.960 --> 13:48.240
<b>Take care of Shizuka.</b>

13:48.410 --> 13:50.190
<b>Huh?! I'm gonna go…</b>

13:50.190 --> 13:52.350
<b>This fight is about protecting Shizuka.</b>

13:53.030 --> 13:54.670
<b>I want to leave her to you.</b>

13:55.420 --> 13:58.730
<b>You three, who helped Gramps so much.</b>

14:00.590 --> 14:01.210
<b>Please.</b>

14:02.810 --> 14:05.940
<b>What's your number-one priority?!</b>

14:06.560 --> 14:08.440
<b>What I have to do right now…</b>

14:09.260 --> 14:10.500
<b>This is it.</b>

14:12.330 --> 14:13.230
<b>Got it.</b>

14:13.690 --> 14:15.240
<b>W-We'll do our best!</b>

14:15.820 --> 14:16.590
<b>Guaranteed.</b>

14:17.690 --> 14:18.510
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:19.270 --> 14:20.830
<b>You're a deva, yeah?</b>

14:21.230 --> 14:22.230
<b>Don't get got.</b>

14:22.440 --> 14:23.270
<b>Oh, my.</b>

14:23.450 --> 14:25.010
<b>You're worried about me?</b>

14:25.390 --> 14:27.330
<b>I'm actually raring to go, here.</b>

14:28.010 --> 14:30.590
<b>If anything, I'm worried I'll go too far.</b>

14:35.700 --> 14:36.810
<b>Now, then.</b>

14:37.680 --> 14:42.030
<b>Kanji and the other Roppo-Ichiza!
Focus on the guys in front of you!</b>

14:42.750 --> 14:44.700
<b>As for the dumpling-headed kid…</b>

14:45.780 --> 14:46.910
<b>I'll take him.</b>

14:50.520 --> 14:51.120
<b>Now.</b>

14:51.500 --> 14:52.090
<b>Seiryu,</b>

14:52.540 --> 14:53.050
<b>Uryu,</b>

14:53.630 --> 14:56.500
<b>I want to get over to him.</b>

14:57.040 --> 14:58.190
<b>Clear me a path.</b>

14:59.170 --> 14:59.820
<b>You got it!</b>

15:06.650 --> 15:08.030
<b>Don't get distracted!</b>

15:11.280 --> 15:13.200
<b>I said don't get distracted.</b>

15:20.470 --> 15:21.960
<b>W-Wow.</b>

15:22.150 --> 15:23.530
<b>They're in perfect sync.</b>

15:24.640 --> 15:25.530
<b>Tsubaki!</b>

15:28.100 --> 15:30.470
<b>Oh, my, an invitation to dance?</b>

15:34.790 --> 15:36.000
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

15:36.580 --> 15:38.000
<b>You need an appointment.</b>

15:39.560 --> 15:40.540
<b>As for you…</b>

15:41.050 --> 15:42.840
<b>What type of song would you like?</b>

15:48.650 --> 15:52.700
<b>You'd better not be thinking "if it
weren't for me" after all this.</b>

15:54.350 --> 15:56.170
<b>S-Sakura…</b>

15:56.600 --> 15:59.070
<b>You said you wanted to stay with everyone.</b>

16:00.060 --> 16:03.130
<b>Now they're fighting to make that happen.</b>

16:04.530 --> 16:06.830
<b>If you feel powerless or frustrated,</b>

16:07.330 --> 16:09.310
<b>shove it all down and brace yourself.</b>

16:09.990 --> 16:13.130
<b>Then watch them put their
bodies on the line for you.</b>

16:14.110 --> 16:18.490
<b>Do that, and I won't let
anyone lay a finger on you.</b>

16:19.320 --> 16:19.980
<b>Okay.</b>

16:21.450 --> 16:22.570
<b>That said,</b>

16:22.910 --> 16:25.660
<b>none of them are coming this way at all.</b>

16:26.440 --> 16:28.900
<b>That's a deva and his aides for you.</b>

16:40.310 --> 16:41.100
<b>Okay!</b>

16:51.170 --> 16:52.600
<b>Got it. Over there, yeah?</b>

17:03.100 --> 17:04.620
<b>Uryu, hang on a sec!</b>

17:10.650 --> 17:13.530
<b>We heard there were a ton,
and this hasn't been easy,</b>

17:13.950 --> 17:16.120
<b>but their numbers are dwindling.</b>

17:16.840 --> 17:19.230
<b>Well, they are against the Roppo-Ichiza.</b>

17:20.060 --> 17:20.990
<b>Not to mention…</b>

17:21.610 --> 17:23.460
<b>those three also worked hard.</b>

17:27.750 --> 17:29.350
<b>Guess this is as far as we go.</b>

17:29.400 --> 17:32.110
<b>I'm your opponent!</b>

17:35.210 --> 17:37.180
<b>All muscle and no brains, as always.</b>

17:37.460 --> 17:39.050
<b>You got me beat, there.</b>

17:39.270 --> 17:41.780
<b>Alright, we'll reach their general in no time!</b>

17:49.690 --> 17:50.440
<b>Tsubaki!</b>

17:51.540 --> 17:52.750
<b>I'm so happy.</b>

17:53.380 --> 17:55.610
<b>You finally got in the mood.</b>

17:56.360 --> 17:58.640
<b>Now, let's dance.</b>

17:59.460 --> 18:01.870
<b>You'll take the lead, won't you?</b>

18:31.310 --> 18:32.610
<b>Wow, that guy…</b>

18:33.140 --> 18:35.760
<b>He has to be good to keep up with Tsubaki.</b>

18:37.110 --> 18:40.730
<b>We outnumbered you so much,
and still we're struggling…</b>

18:41.750 --> 18:44.270
<b>It must be because you get to eat better.</b>

18:45.430 --> 18:46.830
<b>I'll play with you,</b>

18:47.280 --> 18:48.970
<b>so hand over all your money.</b>

19:26.410 --> 19:28.730
<b>Ts-Tsubaki's incredible.</b>

19:28.960 --> 19:31.180
<b>He is one of our four devas, after all.</b>

19:36.940 --> 19:41.000
<b>Dammit. I thought we'd get a big, easy payout,</b>

19:41.680 --> 19:43.610
<b>but this is hardly worth the effort.</b>

19:44.010 --> 19:45.770
<b>You're making a girl suffer…</b>

19:46.330 --> 19:50.320
<b>all so that you can get paid? That's not right!</b>

19:55.020 --> 19:55.840
<b>Who cares?!</b>

19:56.580 --> 20:00.440
<b>It's her fault! She forgot her place
and tried to escape into dreams!</b>

20:06.460 --> 20:07.870
<b>You reap what you sow.</b>

20:08.060 --> 20:09.000
<b>Tsubaki!</b>

20:09.730 --> 20:11.690
<b>He got a hit in on Tsubaki?!</b>

20:11.950 --> 20:13.200
<b>For reals?</b>

20:16.300 --> 20:18.290
<b>You had this stuff on your face?</b>

20:21.440 --> 20:23.790
<b>It tastes like crap, won't fill your belly,</b>

20:24.110 --> 20:25.510
<b>won't wet your whistle,</b>

20:26.240 --> 20:29.550
<b>and you still wear it?
That means you like it, right?</b>

20:30.700 --> 20:32.790
<b>I'm not jealous in the slightest.</b>

20:33.930 --> 20:37.330
<b>Someone who does something so horribly wasteful…</b>

20:37.970 --> 20:40.170
<b>can't possibly beat me!</b>

20:48.210 --> 20:49.170
<b>Well, you see,</b>

20:49.760 --> 20:52.150
<b>makeup makes me stronger.</b>

20:53.100 --> 20:53.620
<b>Huh?</b>

20:54.320 --> 20:55.400
<b>You serious?</b>

20:55.980 --> 20:59.070
<b>Putting that crap on can't
make you better in a fight.</b>

20:59.980 --> 21:00.890
<b>Wrong.</b>

21:01.250 --> 21:03.040
<b>This is what gets stronger.</b>

21:03.770 --> 21:06.990
<b>When I put on makeup, I can become my ideal self.</b>

21:08.140 --> 21:10.770
<b>It makes me happy, and lets me work harder.</b>

21:12.800 --> 21:17.850
<b>Love makes your heart stronger than anything.</b>

21:24.510 --> 21:25.980
<b>You've lost it.</b>

21:26.490 --> 21:27.730
<b>Your heart?</b>

21:28.310 --> 21:31.790
<b>What's the point of making that stronger?</b>

21:32.480 --> 21:33.370
<b>I see.</b>

21:34.060 --> 21:36.400
<b>You don't know how it feels, do you?</b>

21:37.680 --> 21:38.620
<b>Poor thing.</b>

21:40.060 --> 21:45.400
<b>Someone like that can't possibly beat me!</b>

21:49.260 --> 21:50.140
<b>On your feet.</b>

21:51.760 --> 21:54.380
<b>You scoffed at me. Now I'll show you…</b>

21:55.050 --> 21:56.460
<b>how strong I am.</b>

23:30.440 --> 23:33.890
<b>Seiryu and Uryu are twins,
but can you tell them apart?</b>

23:30.970 --> 23:35.810
<b>Uryu</b>

23:30.970 --> 23:35.810
<b>Seiryu</b>

23:33.900 --> 23:35.810
<b>Of course I can! They're my aides.</b>

23:35.820 --> 23:38.120
<b>I should have known! What's the key?</b>

23:38.170 --> 23:40.330
<b>For starters, their shampoo's scent!</b>

23:40.490 --> 23:43.340
<b>Seiryu's picky about his, and it smells great!</b>

23:43.400 --> 23:44.430
<b>Thanks for the tip!</b>
